  "story": {
    "text": "For days Jane wanders, {STARVING}, sleeping out under the sky. She offers her {GLOVES} for a roll, and is refused. At last she sees a girl about to throw cold {PORRIDGE} to a {PIG}. “Will you give me that?” she asks, and eats it {GREEDILY}. In the {RAIN}, she follows a far {LIGHT} across the moor.",
